sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: SSE subscription, replay and targeted reads
  accDescr: Subscription acknowledgement precedes durable replay and the browser snapshot. Owner wakes cause bounded event reads. Heartbeats perform no database polling. Reconnect uses durable cursors and a fresh authorized snapshot.
  participant UI as React
  participant G as ASGI gateway
  participant V as Valkey shard
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant API as Django API
  UI->>G: GET /api/events/<br/>Session + optional cursor
  G->>DB: Bounded session / owner check
  G->>V: Subscribe, wait ACK<br/>Acquire owner connection lease
  G->>DB: Replay owner revisions
  G-->>UI: ready / replay / reset
  UI->>API: Initial / reconnect snapshot
  API-->>UI: Authorized current state
  V-->>G: Minimal owner wake
  G->>DB: Read durable revision gap
  G-->>UI: change IDs + revision
  UI->>API: Affected reads<br/>At most four in flight
  API-->>UI: Saved state
  G-->>UI: Heartbeat, no heartbeat SQL
  Note over UI,G: Hidden / offline: close stream<br/>Outage: jittered SSE reconnect<br/>No automatic REST polling
